id: pinpoint-precision
name: Pinpoint Precision
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 6
requirement: This Signature Technique possesses an AoE of Standard or Minor Magnitude, this Attacking Maneuver does not possess the Concentrated Strike Advantage.
requires: aoe, magnitude<=standard, !has:concentrated-strike
summary: Called Shot allowed against a single target; a hit with it applies 1 Broken until the start of your next turn.
description: >
  Your uncanny accuracy allows you to hit a single target precisely where you want, to terrifying results.
text: >
  Pinpoint Precision: Your uncanny accuracy allows you to hit a single target precisely where you want, to terrifying results.
  –TP Cost: 6
  –Requirement: This Signature Technique possesses an AoE of Standard or Minor Magnitude, this Attacking Maneuver does not possess the Concentrated Strike Advantage.
  –Effect: If this Attacking Maneuver targets only a single Opponent, you can use the Called Shot Maneuver on this Attacking Maneuver. If you hit an Opponent with a Called Shot, apply a rank of the Broken Combat Condition until the start of your next turn.

---

# No script: what this does is read where the Technique is built or the attack is rolled
# (module/technique.mjs, module/signature.mjs). See the plan's feature table.
